se},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":156,"printed":146,"raw":"145/6","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":781,"sub":"reply to Lord Phillimore"}],"id":"t.altamira-m.reponse-a-lord-phillimore","label_en":"reply to Lord Phillimore","label_fr":"réponse à Lord Phillimore","n_pages":2,"pages":[155,156],"parent":"t.altamira-m","printed_en_id":"en.0010.04","printed_fr_id":"fr.0010.04","see":[],"type":"sub"}],"groups":[{"meeting":5,"section":"5","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0149.05","meeting":5,"doc":"minutes","pdf":149,"printed":139,"texts":{"fr":"M. Altamira demande ensuite de faire une déclaration relative aux paroles de Lord Phillimore, qui rappela au cours de la dernière séance, que l'Espagne est le pays de Don Quichote. (Voir annexe 3).","en":"M. Altamira then asked to be allowed to make a statement concerning the words of Lord Phillimore the other day, when he said that Spain was the country of Don Quixote (See Annex 3).","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0149.05","speaker_id":"altamira","certain":true,"name":"Rafael Altamira","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.altamiras-reply-to-lord-phillimore","weight":1.0,"end":136,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":727,"start":53}]},{"seg_id":"s0155.03","meeting":5,"doc":"annex","pdf":155,"printed":145,"texts":{"fr":"J'ai quelques mots à dire à notre illustre collègue Lord Phillimore. Il ne s'agit pas d'une réplique parce qu'on ne peut répliquer qu'aux idées qu'on a comprises; et malgré tous mes efforts il m'a été impossible de comprendre le sens et le but de la spirituelle allusion faite à ma patrie et à Don Quichotte. Quoiqu'il en soit, je regretterais d'avoir donné à notre illustre collègue l'impression de défendre une utopie puremen…","en":"I have a few words to say to our distinguished colleague Lord Phillimore. It is not a reply, because one can only reply to ideas that are understood; and despite my best endeavours I fail to understand the point of this witty allusion to my country and Don Quixote. Whatever the meaning be, I should…","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.altamiras-reply-to-lord-phillimore","weight":1.0,"end":67,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":789,"start":0}]}]},{"meeting":35,"section":"35","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0770.01","meeting":35,"doc":"annex","pdf":770,"printed":760,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"… . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . · V 2. · Déclaration de M. ALTAMIRA (réponse à Lord PHILLIMORE) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . · V 3. · Statement by M. ALTAMIRA (reply to Lord PHILLIMORE) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .…"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.altamiras-reply-to-lord-phillimore","weight":1.0,"end":246,"label":"réponse à Lord Phillimore","lang":"full","start":221},{"concept":"c.altamiras-reply-to-lord-phillimore","weight":1.0,"end":505,"label":"reply to Lord Phillimore","lang":"full","start":481}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"count":0},{"meeting":5,"count":2},{"meeting":6,"count":0},{"meeting":7,"count":0},{"meeting":8,"count":0},{"meeting":9,"count":0},{"meeting":10,"count":0},{"meeting":11,"count":0},{"meeting":12,"count":0},{"meeting":13,"count":0},{"meeting":14,"count":0},{"meeting":15,"count":0},{"meeting":16,"count":0},{"meeting":17,"count":0},{"meeting":18,"count":0},{"meeting":19,"count":0},{"meeting":20,"count":0},{"meeting":21,"count":0},{"meeting":22,"count":0},{"meeting":23,"count":0},{"meeting":24,"count":0},{"meeting":25,"count":0},{"meeting":26,"count":0},{"meeting":27,"c